---
Draw FM algorithm routing diagram in synth editor.

Show a visual diagram of the current FM algorithm's operator routing
(which operators modulate which, which are carriers).

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Diagram shows 4 operator boxes
- [ ] Arrows indicate modulation routing for current algorithm
- [ ] Carrier operators visually distinct from modulators
- [ ] Diagram updates when algorithm is changed
- [ ] All 8 algorithms render correctly

## Test Plan
- [ ] Switch through all 8 algorithms, verify diagram matches expected routing
- [ ] Verify carriers highlighted differently from modulators
- [ ] Visual: compare diagrams to DX7 algorithm reference
